{
  "SM_000040_0050_NAR": "But despite her best intentions,\r\nCereza's gaze drifted back\r\ntowards Avalon Forest.",
  "BK_0020_0000_NAR": "With the household chores complete, \r\nit was time for Cereza's \r\ndaily training in the dark arts.",
  "SM_000070_0090_CER": "“Nothing I do is ever good enough for her.\r\nDid you see those herbs? Flawless!”",
  "BK_0020_0030_NAR": "Before even learning what it did,\r\nCereza was captivated by \r\nthe intricate brace.",
  "SM_000020_0050_CER": "“Jeanne...I-I can't...”",
  "SM_000070_0020_NAR": "All of a sudden, the words from\r\nthe boy in her dream echoed in her ears.",
  "LV_000050_0000_CER": "No...!",
  "BK_0010_0070_NAR": "It was a dream Cereza knew by heart.\r\nBut this time something had changed.\r\n",
  "LV_000900_0000_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]I'm in no mood for pests. \r\nGet ready for a face-full of claw![FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon leapt toward the faeries.",
  "SM_000040_0180_MOR": "",
  "SM_000055_0070_CER": "“Those flowers would really bring\r\nout the colour in Morgana's eyes.”",
  "SM_000040_0060_NAR": "This did not go unnoticed by Morgana.\r\n",
  "SM_000060_0070_MOR": "“Oh, and Cereza,\r\nyour hair today seems to have lost its sheen.\r\nDo not tell me that in addition \r\nto your outdoor tasks,\r\nyou are also neglecting your hair?”",
  "LV_000035_0000_CER": "What?",
  "SM_000060_0110_CER": "“Understood. I'll make sure to finish up\r\nbefore training starts tonight.”",
  "SM_000020_0060_JEA": "“Oh, you big baby.”",
  "SM_000060_0080_CER": "“No ma'am, it's next on my list!”\r\n",
  "SM_000070_0030_LUC": "“Cereza...give you...\r\nthe power to save...mother...”",
  "SM_000060_0000_NAR": "Cereza proudly gave the basket to Morgana.\r\nIt was full to bursting.",
  "LV_000105_0000_CER": "Just a bit more.",
  "BK_0000_0050_NAR": "Her one comfort was the nights \r\nshe snuck into the village jail to visit her mother's cell.",
  "SM_000060_0185_NAR": "That night...",
  "SM_000050_0040_NAR": "This is one job she wished could be\r\nforever stricken from her regimen.",
  "LV_000905_0000_CER": "A chest...\r\nDid the faeries make this?\r\nI wonder what's inside...",
  "BK_0000_0060_NAR": "\r\nHer mother passed each gruelling day barely \r\nable to so much as move in her cold cell. \r\nBut when her daughter came to visit, the witch always showed her a loving smile.",
  "LV_000090_0000_CER": "Dinner time!\r\nOne helping of magic coming right up!",
  "LV_000085_0010_NAR": "They typically burrowed to avoid sunlight, \r\nbut a little bit of magic made them pop right up.",
  "SM_000050_0070_NAR": "Trying not to think about \r\nthe task awaiting her,\r\nCereza headed towards the herb garden.",
  "IN_0010_0040_JEA": "We're almost there, hurry up!",
  "SM_000060_0030_NAR": "Atop the herbs lay a small wreath.\r\nMorgana glanced down at it.",
  "IN_0025_0002_JEA": "Cereza!",
  "SM_000050_0000_NAR": "After laying eyes on the full bucket,\r\nMorgana gave a small nod of approval.",
  "LV_000055_0000_MOR": "Cereza. Cereza-!",
  "BK_0000_0010_NAR": "The clans put in place strict laws \r\nto ensure that strife would never \r\nconsume them. But a pair of \r\nstar-crossed lovers broke this rule\r\nand a child was born with \r\nthe blood of both sage and witch.",
  "BK_0010_0020_LUC": "“Cereza...give you...\r\n...Power to save...mother...”",
  "LV_000005_0000_CER": "Something's there...",
  "SM_000060_0040_NAR": "Her expression unchanged,\r\nshe spoke to Cereza in her usual tone.",
  "SM_000020_0020_JEA": "“What do you think you're doing?”",
  "IN_0010_0000_JEA": "Hurry up Cereza, \r\nwe don't have all night!",
  "LV_000935_0000_CER": "Almost time for today's training.\r\nI'd better hurry or I'm in for another lecture.",
  "BK_0020_0200_NAR": "Morgana turned and walked away, \r\nignoring her pupil's desperate plea.",
  "BK_0000_0020_NAR": "It was a beautiful baby girl.",
  "SM_000070_0050_NAR": "Cereza's eyes wandered back to the forest.\r\nMorgana's repeated warnings\r\nleft little room for ambiguity. And yet...",
  "IN_0010_0030_CER": "T-thanks!",
  "SM_000070_0140_CER": "“I mean, if I just had another \r\nchance to get the hang of it,\r\nI could have gotten that demon\r\ntotally under wraps.”",
  "IN_0000_0040_WIC": "“What do you think you're doing!?”",
  "BK_0010_0110_CER": "“The forbidden forest...”",
  "IN_0000_0030_WID": "You don't belong here!",
  "SM_000055_0000_CER": "“Yes, I did it!” ",
  "SM_000040_0100_CER": "“Yes Morgana, I know...”",
  "SM_000055_0030_CER": "“I can't wait to see the look \r\non Morgana's face!”",
  "SM_000030_0000_JEA": "“Oh no, they're onto us.\r\nLeave the guards to me.\r\nYou hurry on ahead!”",
  "IN_0025_0004_JEA": "This way!",
  "SM_000040_0110_MOR": "“Well then, stop your dreaming\r\nand finish those chores \r\nbefore moonrise, young lady.”",
  "BK_0010_0060_CER": "“That dream again...\r\nBut the ending...”",
  "SM_000040_0160_NAR": "Cereza often reminded herself\r\nthat these chores were all part \r\nof her training.",
  "LV_000080_0000_NAR": "Fetching a pail of water...\r\nIt may seem like a simple chore, ",
  "BK_0020_0100_NAR": "Cereza's spirits were high.\r\nShe was determined to succeed.",
  "SM_000070_0080_NAR": "This thought got Cereza's blood boiling.\r\nGrievances started bubbling up.",
  "SM_000070_0110_NAR": "As she blew off steam to Cheshire,\r\nshe noticed Morgana's brace\r\nshining in the moonlight.",
  "BK_0010_0140_NAR": "Cereza's teacher Morgana was standing by the door, \r\nher frown discernible even from a distance.",
  "SM_000040_0040_CER": "“Yes ma'am, I'll get to them right away!”",
  "SM_000040_0150_NAR": "Morgana had also been cast out\r\nof the village.\r\nShe understood Cereza's pain,\r\nand her stern treatment came \r\nfrom a place of love.",
  "BK_0010_0130_MOR": "“Cereza, where are you my dear?”",
  "BK_0010_0050_CER": "“I'll go, I promise!” ",
  "SM_000060_0020_CER": "“I also picked these violets...\r\nThey're for you. \r\nI thought you might like them...”",
  "SM_000060_0130_NAR": "With this Morgana turned\r\nand walked back towards the house.",
  "SM_000050_0060_CER": "“No, ma'am!”",
  "LV_000910_0000_CER": "He-hey! Give me a break!\r\n",
  "BK_0000_0150_NAR": "Her name was Cereza.",
  "IN_0025_0003_JEA": "They'll find us!",
  "LV_000110_0000_CER": "There we go!",
  "SM_000060_0010_CER": "“How about that, Morgana?\r\nQuite the harvest, wouldn't you say?”",
  "LV_000020_0000_CER": "R, right!",
  "BK_0000_0120_NAR": "Turning her back on the village,\r\nthe girl was taken in by an \r\nexiled witch, who lived on \r\nthe outskirts of town.",
  "LV_000920_0000_CER": "“Mummy...?”",
  "SM_000060_0090_MOR": "“Remember Cereza...”",
  "IN_0020_0030_WIA": "What a burden!",
  "SM_000020_0080_JEA": "",
  "SM_000060_0170_NAR": "Making a quick recovery,\r\nCereza resolved to finish her\r\nremaining chores in record time.",
  "SM_000060_0100_MOR": "“Hair is the most versatile tool\r\nof an Umbra Witch. It can be shaped\r\ninto our armour, weapons, and even used\r\nas a medium for summoning Infernal Demons.\r\nAs blood flows through veins,\r\nmagic flows through a witch's hair.\r\nCare for it as you would your most\r\nprecious tool, and defend it as you would\r\nyour very heart.”",
  "LV_001025_0010_NAR": "As soon as the scent reached Cheshire \r\nhe pulled away, face scrunched up in disgust.",
  "LV_000120_0000_CER": "Blegh...I wouldn't mind\r\nif it weren't for this smell...",
  "SM_000070_0170_LUC": "“Avalon Forest...\r\nThe white wolf...guide you...”",
  "IN_0020_0000_WIA": "Why don't you just leave!",
  "LV_001025_0020_NAR": "It looked like demons could not stand \r\nbeing anywhere near the flower.",
  "BK_0000_0080_NAR": "On the night of the girl's tenth \r\nbirthday, her mother was \r\nto be moved to a deeper cell,\r\nwhere even the faintest memory\r\nof daylight could not reach her.",
  "LV_000010_0000_CER": "Why would you say that...?",
  "BK_0000_0110_NAR": "Many moons have since passed.",
  "LV_00015_0010_CER": "Jeanne, wait!\r\nYou make everything \r\nlook so easy.",
  "LV_000075_0000_CER": "Erg...\r\nI just had to fill it right to brim!",
  "PH_0020_0010_NAR": "Little did she know that\r\nwhat lay waiting in those dark woods\r\nwould change her fate forever.",
  "SM_000055_0020_NAR": "She usually managed to make a mess\r\nwith even this rudimentary magic.",
  "BK_0010_0010_CER": "“Who are you?”",
  "SM_000055_0010_NAR": "Cereza was pleasantly surprised.",
  "IN_0000_0010_WIB": "She'll bring misfortune on us all...",
  "LV_000125_0000_NAR": "Cereza shivered at the thought of what lay ahead.\r\nBut curiosity got the better of her.",
  "SM_000070_0150_NAR": "With a demon by her side,\r\neviscerating a faerie or two \r\nwould be child's play.",
  "SM_000070_0040_CER": "“Avalon Forest...”",
  "BK_0020_0140_NAR": "This looked like trouble. Unless bound by hair,\r\nthere would be no way to control the demon.",
  "BK_0000_0040_NAR": "The witch clan took in the young \r\ngirl, but she grew up shunned \r\nas a pariah, cursed by \r\nthe circumstance of her birth.",
  "BK_0020_0210_MOR": "“What kind of witch fears\r\nher own summoned familiar?\r\nI was foolish to think you \r\nwere ready for this training.”",
  "SM_000020_0070_JEA": "“Come on, I'll lead the way!”",
  "SM_000020_0040_JEA": "“Cereza, you're almost out of time!\r\nThis is your last chance...\r\nIf you don't hurry you may\r\nnever see your mother again.”",
  "SM_000060_0050_MOR": "“Do not expect praise for\r\nthis sort of perfunctory performance.”\r\n",
  "BK_0000_0070_NAR": "But even this small happiness\r\neventually came to an end.",
  "LV_000040_0000_CER": "Nngghhh... nghh....!",
  "BK_0010_0040_LUC": "“Avalon Forest...\r\nThe white wolf...guide you...”",
  "LV_000085_0000_NAR": "The herbs in Morgana's garden were not \r\nyour common basil or thyme. She grew \r\nInfernal plants with an absolutely foul stench.",
  "SM_000050_0010_MOR": "“Good. Now collect the herbs \r\nfrom the garden.”",
  "SM_000070_0000_NAR": "Long after Morgana was gone,\r\nCereza sat moping in the garden.\r\nOut of habit, she shared her\r\ntroubles with Cheshire.",
  "BK_0020_0060_MOR": "“Furthermore, we train under the\r\nfull moon of the bissextile night,\r\nwhen the dark energy we Umbra\r\nharness is at its zenith...\r\n\r\nAre you listening, young lady?”",
  "BK_0020_0010_NAR": "Today she was finally going to get\r\na chance to attempt a spell she had\r\nbeen practising for weeks:\r\nsummoning an Infernal Demon!",
  "LV_000025_0000_CER": "Just a little longer...\r\nHold on, Mummy.",
  "BK_0020_0090_CER": "“Yes ma'am.”",
  "LV_000115_0000_CER": "That's enough, right?",
  "SM_000010_0000_CER": "I've got to hurry...",
  "SM_000040_0000_MOR": "“Chores neglected, and I find my \r\napprentice enjoying her beauty sleep...”",
  "LV_000915_0000_CER": "Wow...\r\nJeanne, you're amazing!",
  "BK_0020_0050_MOR": "“This is a tool for those who\r\nhave yet to master the flow of magic.”",
  "IN_0000_0020_WIC": "Stay away, she can't be trusted!",
  "SM_000070_0120_CER": "“W-what are you saying, Cheshire?\r\nTake the brace and sneak into the forest?!\r\nMorgana would give us \r\na right smack on the bottom!”",
  "BK_0010_0090_CER": "“A strange boy appeared \r\nand told me something incredible.\r\nHe said if I went to Avalon Forest\r\nhe'd give me a fantastic power.”",
  "LV_000015_0000_CER": "Jeanne, wait! \r\nI can't run that fast.",
  "SM_000040_0070_MOR": "“If I've told you once...\r\nCereza, you must never enter that forest.”",
  "BK_0010_0100_CER": "“If we had that, rescuing\r\nMummy would be a piece of cake.”",
  "BK_0020_0020_MOR": "“For today's training \r\nI will give you a little help.”",
  "LV_000925_0000_CER": "“What is this...? Don't come any closer!”",
  "BK_0020_0180_MOR": "“We are finished for today.”",
  "SM_000070_0160_CER": "“That's it, I'm going to that forest!\r\nAnd when I come back \r\nwith that fantastic power, \r\nMorgana will take back everything\r\nshe said about me not being ready. \r\nLet's go Cheshire. Next stop, Avalon!”",
  "SM_000070_0070_NAR": "Adults do often exaggerate to\r\nkeep kids in their place.",
  "SM_000020_0000_CER": "“Mummy...”",
  "SM_000040_0120_CER": "“All right...water from the well, \r\ncoming right up.”",
  "SM_000040_0030_NAR": "Cereza began making an excuse,\r\nbut Morgana's scowl stopped her\r\nin her tracks.",
  "IN_0025_0001_JEA": "Stop dallying!",
  "BK_0020_0220_NAR": "Morgana told Cereza to put away\r\nthe magic brace before\r\nheading back to the house.",
  "SM_000060_0140_CER": "“Yes ma'am...”",
  "BK_0000_0000_NAR": "Long ago, there existed two clans,\r\nthe Lumen Sages of light,\r\nand the Umbra Witches of darkness.\r\nTogether they controlled \r\na mysterious power.",
  "LV_000940_0000_CER": "My magic feels more powerful than before...\r\nCould it be the brace?",
  "LV_000005_0010_CER": "This place...",
  "LV_000055_0010_MOR": "Where are you, Cereza?!",
  "SM_000050_0050_MOR": "“Do we have a problem?”",
  "BK_0000_0030_NAR": "As punishment for their forbidden\r\nlove, the pair were torn asunder;\r\nthe girl's sage father was exiled \r\nto a far land, and her mother \r\nlocked away in a solitary jail.",
  "SM_000050_0020_NAR": "At the thought of herbs,\r\nCereza could not help but make a face.",
  "IN_0010_0010_JEA": "Here, use this!",
  "LV_000070_0000_CER": "Mmmnnh!",
  "SM_000030_0010_CER": "“Wait, Jeanne! I can't do this alone.”",
  "BK_0000_0140_NAR": "She was determined to be a powerful \r\nwitch, and one day save her mother.",
  "SM_000070_0130_NAR": "Although, with the moon shining brightly,\r\nit was the ideal chance for a little\r\nsurreptitious forest excursion. ",
  "BK_0020_0120_NAR": "Step by step Cereza flawlessly\r\nperformed the summoning dance.\r\nUntil...",
  "SM_000040_0090_MOR": "“With your current abilities\r\nyou would soon become a snack\r\nfor one of the faeries who live there.”",
  "LV_000095_0000_CER": "Hurry on out!",
  "IN_0025_0000_JEA": "Hurry!",
  "SM_000040_0170_NAR": "Eager to please her master,\r\nshe hurried off towards the well.",
  "LV_000080_0010_NAR": "but it requires a fine sense of control,\r\nmaking it perfect for Umbran training.",
  "SM_000040_0140_NAR": "Despite her strict exterior, Cereza \r\nhad grown attached to her teacher.",
  "LV_000100_0000_CER": "Good!",
  "IN_0000_0000_WIA": "The sullied child!",
  "SM_000040_0130_MOR": "“A simple 'yes' will suffice, Cereza. \r\nOff you go.”",
  "SM_000055_0040_NAR": "Cereza hummed a happy tune \r\nwhile picking the herbs.\r\nAs she bent down she noticed a \r\npretty flower growing amongst the weeds.",
  "LV_000030_0000_CER": "Mummy!",
  "LV_000060_0000_MOR": "Cereza. \r\nHave you finished your chores?",
  "SM_000070_0010_CER": "“Forget returning to the village\r\nand saving Mummy. At this rate\r\nI'll never even become a witch.”",
  "BK_0020_0190_CER": "“L-let me try again.\r\nPlease!”",
  "BK_0010_0120_NAR": "The oft-repeated warning from Cereza's teacher\r\nrung in her ears: “Avalon Forest is home to faeries, \r\ncreatures who love to whisk away children. Stay away!”",
  "BK_0010_0030_CER": "Power?",
  "BK_0020_0160_NAR": "The demon turned to ash \r\nmere inches from Cereza.\r\nWithout a proper medium,\r\ndemons will soon die in our world.",
  "PH_0020_0000_NAR": "And so, Cereza threw caution\r\n(and her teacher's warnings) to the wind,\r\nand set out towards Avalon Forest.",
  "SM_000070_0060_CER": "“Morgana is always 'dangerous' this\r\nand 'stay away' that...How could a dank\r\nold forest be that scary a place anyway?”",
  "BK_0020_0080_MOR": "“You seem determined today. \r\nPerhaps I should let you nap \r\nmore often.”",
  "LV_000930_0000_CER": "No one told me they could do this!\r\nI've gotta catch it quick!",
  "LV_000130_0000_CER": "Let's go, Cheshire.",
  "SM_000040_0010_CER": "“I'm sorry,\r\nI just closed my eyes for a second...”\r\n",
  "LV_000945_0010_CER": "That was not fun.",
  "BK_0010_0080_NAR": "Cereza decided to consult\r\nher friend Cheshire.",
  "LV_001025_0000_NAR": "The pungent scent tickled Cereza's nose.\r\nIt was rosemary, often used to ward off evil spirits.",
  "LV_000065_0000_CER": "Mmph...mmph...",
  "IN_0020_0020_WIA": "Serves her right!",
  "SM_000060_0160_NAR": "But she knew that\r\nMorgana cared for her,\r\nand only wanted what was best for her.",
  "BK_0000_0130_NAR": "Under her strict guidance, \r\nthe girl continued to train\r\nin the ways of the dark arts.",
  "BK_0000_0100_NAR": "More alone than ever before, the young girl clung\r\nto all she had left: a stuffed cat named Cheshire,\r\nwhich her mother had made for her long ago.",
  "LV_000010_0010_CER": "Leave me alone...!",
  "BK_0000_0090_NAR": "In desperation\r\nthe girl tried a daring rescue.\r\nBut with only a child's strength, \r\nthe attempt was in vain.",
  "SM_000060_0120_MOR": "“Good. Now, get back to your chores.\r\nThe shadows grow long;\r\nthe moon will soon rise.”",
  "SM_000060_0150_NAR": "At times Morgana's cold\r\ntreatment got Cereza down.",
  "IN_0020_0010_WIA": "Nobody wants you!"
}
